<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>IGFinder 2.0 · Manual de Uso por Pestaña</title>
<style>
  :root{
    /* ── Paleta exacta del programa (índigo cálido + femenina) ── */
    --bg:#1a1840; --bg2:#201e48; --panel:#282550; --panel2:#302c62;
    --glass:#38356a; --void:#131028;
    --cyan:#b18fe8; --cyan2:#9b7dd4; --violet:#d4a8f0; --lavender:#e0ccff;
    --orchid:#da70d6; --teal:#e8a8d8; --rose:#ff85c0; --blush:#ffb3d1;
    --magenta:#e040a0; --peach:#ffc5a8; --emerald:#f0b8e8; --sage:#b8e8c8;
    --amber:#f8d0ee; --gold:#ffd700; --red:#ff7099;
    --border:#7b68c8; --border-d:#5248a0; --border-dd:#38346a;
    --txt:#f0e8ff; --txt-dim:#c8b8f0; --txt-muted:#8878b8;
    --mono:"Courier New",ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
  body{
    background:
      radial-gradient(900px 600px at 85% -5%, rgba(218,112,214,.10), transparent 60%),
      radial-gradient(700px 500px at -5% 30%, rgba(177,143,232,.10), transparent 55%),
      var(--bg);
    color:var(--txt); font-family:var(--mono); font-size:14px; line-height:1.6;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  }
  a{color:var(--cyan);text-decoration:none}

  /* ── Banda tricolor superior (idéntica al titlebar real) ── */
  .topband{height:3px;display:flex;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50}
  .topband i{flex:1}
  .topband i:nth-child(1){background:var(--teal)}
  .topband i:nth-child(2){background:var(--orchid)}
  .topband i:nth-child(3){background:var(--rose)}
  .topband i:nth-child(4){background:var(--lavender)}

  /* ── Encabezado del programa ── */
  header.app{
    background:var(--void); border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-dd);
    padding:10px 22px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:14px;
    position:sticky; top:3px; z-index:40;
  }
  .dna{font-size:22px;letter-spacing:-3px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--lavender),var(--orchid),var(--rose));
    -webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent;filter:saturate(1.2)}
  .app h1{font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;color:var(--lavender);letter-spacing:.5px}
  .app .sub{font-size:11px;color:var(--txt-muted)}
  .app .sep{color:var(--border-d);font-size:18px;margin:0 4px}
  .app .pill{margin-left:auto;font-size:10px;font-weight:bold;color:var(--emerald);
    background:rgba(240,184,232,.13);border:1px solid rgba(240,184,232,.4);
    padding:4px 10px;border-radius:3px}

  /* ── Layout: sidebar + contenido ── */
  .shell{display:grid;grid-template-columns:230px 1fr;gap:0;align-items:start}
  nav.side{
    position:sticky; top:62px; height:calc(100vh - 62px); overflow:auto;
    background:var(--bg2); border-right:1px solid var(--border-dd);
    padding:14px 10px;
  }
  nav.side .navlabel{font-size:9px;letter-spacing:2px;color:var(--txt-muted);
    padding:8px 10px 4px;text-transform:uppercase}
  nav.side a.nav{
    display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;padding:8px 11px;border-radius:5px;
    color:var(--txt-muted);font-size:12.5px;font-weight:bold;cursor:pointer;
    border-left:3px solid transparent;transition:.15s;
  }
  nav.side a.nav .dot{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:currentColor;flex:none}
  nav.side a.nav:hover{color:var(--txt-dim);background:rgba(255,255,255,.03)}
  main{padding:0 30px 90px;max-width:1080px}

  /* ── Intro ── */
  .intro{padding:34px 0 10px}
  .intro .eyebrow{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:3px;color:var(--orchid);text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:10px}
  .intro h2{font-size:30px;font-weight:bold;color:var(--txt);line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:14px}
  .intro h2 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--cyan)}
  .intro p{color:var(--txt-dim);max-width:760px;margin-bottom:10px;font-size:14px}
  .legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:18px}
  .legend .chip{font-size:11px;padding:4px 11px;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid var(--border-dd);
    background:var(--panel);color:var(--txt-dim)}
  .legend .chip b{color:var(--txt)}

  /* ── Sección de pestaña ── */
  section.tab{padding-top:44px;scroll-margin-top:74px;border-top:1px solid var(--border-dd);margin-top:34px}
  section.tab:first-of-type{border-top:none}
  .tabhead{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:14px;margin-bottom:6px}
  .tabhead .ic{
    width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:9px;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:22px;flex:none;
  }
  .tabhead .meta .kicker{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:bold}
  .tabhead .meta h3{font-size:23px;font-weight:bold;color:var(--txt);line-height:1.15;margin:2px 0}
  .tabhead .meta .lede{color:var(--txt-muted);font-size:12.5px}

  .blocklabel{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--txt-muted);
    margin:26px 0 10px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
  .blocklabel::after{content:"";flex:1;height:1px;background:var(--border-dd)}

  /* ── Mockup “marco de app” ── */
  .screen{
    background:var(--bg); border:1px solid var(--border-dd); border-radius:9px;
    overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 18px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.4);
  }
  .screen .barrow{display:flex;background:var(--bg2);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-dd);overflow:hidden}
  .screen .tabbtn{font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;color:var(--txt-muted);padding:9px 13px;white-space:nowrap;
    border-bottom:2px solid transparent}
  .screen .tabbtn.active{color:var(--txt)}
  .screen .body{padding:12px;display:grid;gap:9px}

  /* paneles internos del mockup */
  .pane{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--border-dd);border-radius:7px;overflow:hidden}
  .pane>.h{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:7px 11px;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold}
  .pane>.h .accent{width:4px;align-self:stretch;border-radius:2px}
  .pane>.bd{padding:11px;display:grid;gap:9px}
  .field label{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--txt-muted);margin-bottom:3px}
  .input{background:#0e0c22;border:1px solid var(--border-dd);border-radius:4px;padding:7px 9px;
    font-size:12px;color:var(--cyan)}
  .input.ph{color:var(--txt-muted)}
  .hint{font-size:9.5px;color:var(--txt-dim);font-style:italic}
  .btns{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}
  .b{font-size:11px;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid var(--border-d);
    background:var(--panel2);color:var(--txt-dim);cursor:default}
  .b.solid{border:none;font-weight:bold}
  .b.run{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--emerald),var(--teal));color:#231a33;font-weight:bold;
    padding:11px;text-align:center;font-size:12.5px}
  .b.stop{background:rgba(255,112,153,.16);border:1px solid rgba(255,112,153,.45);color:var(--red);
    font-weight:bold;padding:9px;text-align:center}
  .tag{display:inline-flex;font-size:10px;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:3px;font-weight:bold}

  /* toggle row */
  .toggle{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;
    padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(120,108,184,.14)}
  .toggle:last-child{border-bottom:none}
  .toggle .t-info b{display:block;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--txt-dim)}
  .toggle .t-info span{font-size:9.5px;color:var(--txt-muted)}
  .sw{width:34px;height:18px;border-radius:10px;position:relative;flex:none;background:var(--border-dd)}
  .sw.on{background:var(--emerald)}
  .sw::after{content:"";position:absolute;top:2px;left:2px;width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff}
  .sw.on::after{left:18px}

  /* mini stat cards */
  .cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:8px}
  .card{border-radius:7px;padding:9px 11px}
  .card .ct{font-size:8px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:.5px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px}
  .card .cv{font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;margin-top:3px}

  /* sliders */
  .slider{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:5px 0}
  .slider .lab{font-size:11px;color:var(--txt-muted);width:160px}
  .slider .track{flex:1;height:5px;border-radius:3px;background:var(--border-dd);position:relative}
  .slider .track i{position:absolute;top:-4px;width:13px;height:13px;border-radius:50%}
  .slider .val{font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;width:64px;text-align:right}

  /* fake chart / placeholder */
  .ph-box{min-height:150px;display:grid;place-items:center;text-align:center;border-radius:6px;
    border:1px dashed var(--border-d);background:rgba(255,255,255,.015);color:var(--txt-muted);
    font-size:11px;line-height:1.7;padding:14px;white-space:pre-line}
  .bars{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:6px;height:120px;padding:6px}
  .bars i{flex:1;border-radius:3px 3px 0 0;opacity:.85}

  /* table */
  table.t{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:11px}
  table.t th{text-align:left;color:var(--cyan);font-weight:bold;background:rgba(177,143,232,.12);
    padding:6px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-dd);font-size:10px}
  table.t td{padding:6px 8px;color:var(--txt-dim);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(120,108,184,.12)}
  table.t tr:nth-child(even) td{background:var(--panel2)}

  /* terminal */
  .term{background:#0c0a1f;border:1px solid var(--border-dd);border-radius:7px;overflow:hidden}
  .term .tt{background:#15122d;padding:6px 11px;font-size:11px;color:var(--txt-muted);display:flex;gap:7px;align-items:center}
  .term pre{padding:11px;font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.7;white-space:pre-wrap}
  .c-ok{color:var(--emerald)} .c-warn{color:var(--amber)} .c-err{color:var(--red)}
  .c-info{color:var(--txt-dim)} .c-dim{color:var(--txt-muted)}

  /* chromosome grid */
  .chrgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(8,1fr);gap:4px}
  .chrgrid .cc{font-size:9px;text-align:center;padding:7px 0;border-radius:4px;font-weight:bold;
    border:1px solid var(--border-dd);color:var(--txt-muted);background:var(--panel2)}

  /* sub-panel A-F grid */
  .subgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px}

  /* dial */
  .dial{width:118px;height:118px;border-radius:50%;margin:0 auto;
    background:conic-gradient(var(--teal) 0 38%, var(--cyan) 38% 64%, var(--violet) 64% 78%, var(--border-dd) 78% 100%);
    display:grid;place-items:center}
  .dial .inner{width:78px;height:78px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--panel);display:grid;place-items:center;
    text-align:center}
  .dial .inner b{font-size:18px;color:var(--lavender)} .dial .inner span{font-size:8px;color:var(--txt-muted)}

  /* manual blocks */
  .manual{margin-top:18px;display:grid;gap:14px}
  .purpose{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--border-dd);border-left-width:4px;
    border-radius:7px;padding:14px 16px}
  .purpose .lbl{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--txt-muted);margin-bottom:5px}
  .purpose p{color:var(--txt-dim);font-size:13px}
  .steps{counter-reset:s;display:grid;gap:9px}
  .steps .step{display:grid;grid-template-columns:26px 1fr;gap:11px;align-items:start;
    background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--border-dd);border-radius:7px;padding:11px 13px}
  .steps .step::before{counter-increment:s;content:counter(s);width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;
    display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;background:var(--panel2);color:var(--cyan);
    border:1px solid var(--border-d)}
  .steps .step b{color:var(--txt)}
  .steps .step p{color:var(--txt-dim);font-size:12.5px;margin-top:2px}

  .ref{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--border-dd);border-radius:7px;overflow:hidden}
  .ref .rh{padding:9px 14px;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:.5px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-dd)}
  table.ref-t{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:12.5px}
  table.ref-t td{padding:9px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(120,108,184,.13);vertical-align:top}
  table.ref-t tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none}
  table.ref-t td:first-child{width:230px;color:var(--txt);font-weight:bold}
  table.ref-t td:first-child code{background:#0e0c22;border:1px solid var(--border-dd);border-radius:3px;
    padding:1px 6px;font-size:11px;color:var(--cyan)}
  table.ref-t td:last-child{color:var(--txt-dim)}
  .note{font-size:12px;color:var(--txt-dim);background:rgba(248,208,238,.07);border:1px solid rgba(248,208,238,.28);
    border-radius:7px;padding:11px 14px}
  .note b{color:var(--amber)}

  footer{padding:40px 30px;color:var(--txt-muted);font-size:11px;border-top:1px solid var(--border-dd);
    max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto}

  /* ── Instalación: bloques de código, OS, callouts ── */
  .codeblock{background:#0c0a1f;border:1px solid var(--border-dd);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;margin:2px 0}
  .codeblock .cbh{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:#15122d;padding:6px 12px;
    font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.5px;color:var(--txt-muted);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-dd)}
  .codeblock .cbh .dots{display:flex;gap:5px}
  .codeblock .cbh .dots i{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;display:block}
  .codeblock .cbh .lang{margin-left:auto;color:var(--cyan);font-weight:bold}
  .codeblock pre{padding:12px 14px;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.65;overflow-x:auto;white-space:pre;color:var(--txt-dim)}
  .codeblock pre .cm{color:var(--txt-muted);font-style:italic}
  .codeblock pre .pr{color:var(--orchid)}     /* prompt $ */
  .codeblock pre .cmd{color:var(--lavender)}  /* comando */
  .codeblock pre .fl{color:var(--teal)}       /* flags / args */
  .codeblock pre .ok{color:var(--emerald)}
  .codeblock pre .st{color:var(--blush)}      /* strings */

  .os-tabs{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:4px 0 2px}
  .os-tab{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;padding:8px 14px;border-radius:7px 7px 0 0;
    border:1px solid var(--border-dd);border-bottom:none;background:var(--panel);color:var(--txt-muted)}
  .os-tab.win{color:var(--cyan);background:rgba(177,143,232,.10);border-color:rgba(177,143,232,.4)}
  .os-tab.mac{color:var(--lavender);background:rgba(224,204,255,.10);border-color:rgba(224,204,255,.4)}
  .os-tab.lin{color:var(--emerald);background:rgba(240,184,232,.10);border-color:rgba(240,184,232,.4)}
  .os-pane{border:1px solid var(--border-dd);border-radius:0 8px 8px 8px;padding:13px;background:var(--panel);margin-bottom:8px}
  .os-pane>.t{font-size:11px;color:var(--txt-muted);margin-bottom:8px}
  .os-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:10px;align-items:start}

  .callout{border-radius:8px;padding:12px 15px;font-size:12.5px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:22px 1fr;gap:11px;align-items:start}
  .callout .ci{font-size:16px;line-height:1.3}
  .callout p{color:var(--txt-dim)} .callout b{color:var(--txt)}
  .callout code{background:#0e0c22;border:1px solid var(--border-dd);border-radius:3px;padding:1px 5px;font-size:11px;color:var(--cyan)}
  .callout.tip{background:rgba(184,232,200,.07);border:1px solid rgba(184,232,200,.3)}
  .callout.tip .ci{color:var(--sage)}
  .callout.warn{background:rgba(248,208,238,.07);border:1px solid rgba(248,208,238,.32)}
  .callout.warn .ci{color:var(--amber)}
  .callout.info{background:rgba(177,143,232,.07);border:1px solid rgba(177,143,232,.3)}
  .callout.info .ci{color:var(--cyan)}

  .reqgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:9px;margin:2px 0}
  .reqcard{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--border-dd);border-radius:8px;padding:12px}
  .reqcard .rk{font-size:9px;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--txt-muted)}
  .reqcard .rv{font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;color:var(--txt);margin-top:3px}
  .reqcard .rs{font-size:10px;color:var(--txt-dim);margin-top:2px}

  .deptable{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:12.5px;background:var(--panel);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden}
  .deptable th{text-align:left;background:rgba(255,215,0,.10);color:var(--gold);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.5px;
    padding:9px 13px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-dd)}
  .deptable td{padding:9px 13px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(120,108,184,.13);color:var(--txt-dim);vertical-align:top}
  .deptable td:first-child{color:var(--txt);font-weight:bold;white-space:nowrap}
  .deptable td code{background:#0e0c22;border:1px solid var(--border-dd);border-radius:3px;padding:1px 6px;font-size:11px;color:var(--cyan)}
  .deptable tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none}
  .pin{display:inline-block;font-size:9px;font-weight:bold;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:3px;margin-left:6px}
  .pin.req{background:rgba(232,168,216,.16);color:var(--teal)}
  .pin.opt{background:rgba(248,208,238,.16);color:var(--amber)}

  @media (max-width:880px){
    .shell{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    nav.side{display:none}
    main{padding:0 16px 70px}
    .cards{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
    .subgrid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .reqgrid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
    .os-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    table.ref-t td:first-child{width:auto}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="topband"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>

<header class="app">
  <span class="dna">⬡⬢⬡</span>
  <div>
    <h1>IGFinder 2.0 <span class="sep">·</span></h1>
  </div>
  <div>
    <div style="font-weight:bold;color:var(--txt)">Intronless Gene Architecture Analyzer</div>
    <div class="sub">Single-Exon Gene Detection · Structural Comparative Analysis</div>
  </div>
  <span class="pill">MANUAL DE USO</span>
</header>

<div class="shell">

  <!-- SIDEBAR — réplica de la navegación de la app -->
  <nav class="side">
    <div class="navlabel">Empezar</div>
    <a class="nav" href="#install" style="color:var(--gold)">   <span class="dot"></span> ⤓ Instalación</a>
    <div class="navlabel" style="margin-top:14px">Pestañas</div>
    <a class="nav" href="#scan"    style="color:var(--teal)">    <span class="dot"></span> ✿ Scan</a>
    <a class="nav" href="#config"  style="color:var(--blush)">   <span class="dot"></span> ⚙ Config</a>
    <a class="nav" href="#monitor" style="color:var(--orchid)">  <span class="dot"></span> ⊙ Monitor</a>
    <a class="nav" href="#omics"   style="color:var(--emerald)"> <span class="dot"></span> ⬡ OMICS</a>
    <a class="nav" href="#cross"   style="color:var(--cyan)">    <span class="dot"></span> ⬢ Cross Species</a>
    <a class="nav" href="#plots"   style="color:var(--violet)">  <span class="dot"></span> ◈ Plots</a>
    <a class="nav" href="#results" style="color:var(--lavender)"><span class="dot"></span> ✦ Results</a>
    <a class="nav" href="#log"     style="color:var(--cyan)">    <span class="dot"></span> ◉ Log</a>
    <div class="navlabel" style="margin-top:14px">Referencia</div>
    <a class="nav" href="#top" style="color:var(--txt-muted)"><span class="dot"></span> ↑ Inicio</a>
  </nav>

  <main id="top">

    <!-- INTRO -->
    <div class="intro">
      <div class="eyebrow">Genómica comparativa · Detección de genes sin intrones</div>
      <h2>Manual de uso, pestaña por pestaña<br>de <em>IGFinder 2.0</em></h2>
      <p>IGFinder analiza la arquitectura de genes para detectar <b>genes sin intrones (IG)</b>, los separa de los <b>genes multi-exón (MEG)</b> y los <b>genes con intrones solo en UTR (ui-SEG)</b>, y los compara entre genomas usando la API REST de Ensembl y Ensembl Compara.</p>
      <p>La ventana se organiza en <b>ocho pestañas</b>. Este manual abre con una guía de <b>instalación desde cero</b> y luego reproduce la interfaz de cada pestaña con su misma paleta y tipografía, explicando para qué sirve, cómo se usa y qué hace cada control.</p>
      <div class="legend">
        <span class="chip"><b>IG</b> · Intronless Gene (sin intrones)</span>
        <span class="chip"><b>MEG</b> · Multi-Exon Gene</span>
        <span class="chip"><b>ui-SEG</b> · UTR-intronless Single-Exon Gene</span>
        <span class="chip">Fuente: <b>Ensembl REST</b> + <b>Compara</b></span>
        <span class="chip">Ventana base <b>1200×780</b></span>
      </div>
    </div>


